  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Polisetty Sudhakar vs State Of Ap on 17 July, 2019 Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Crl.P.No. 4155 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. seeking to quash the proceedings against the petitioner/Accused No.1 in FIR.No.180 of 2019 on the file of the Narsaraopet II Town Police Station. The offences alleged are under Sections 188, 270, 273, 328, 420 IPC and Sections 56, 57 and 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "This Court has heard Sri D.Kasi Rao, learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Public Prosecutor for respondent-State. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that in a similar case, this Court, by virtue of common order in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein by considering that transportation of Gutka is not attracted by the offences alleged under Sections 188, 270 and 273 of IPC and Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "This Court has heard Sri D.Kasi Rao, learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Public Prosecutor for respondent-State. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that in a similar case, this Court, by virtue of common order in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein by considering that transportation of Gutka is not attracted by the offences alleged under Sections 188, 270 and 273 of IPC and Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
